{"root":"cicip","ipa":"/tʃitʃip/","core":"指为了品尝味道而小口尝试，通常指试吃或试喝。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃitʃip/","zh":"品尝，试吃，试喝","phrases":[{"t":"cicip sedikit","zh":"尝一点点"},{"t":"cicip masakan","zh":"品尝菜肴"},{"t":"coba cicip","zh":"试着尝尝"}],"examples":[{"t":"Ibu sedang cicip sup yang baru dimasak.","zh":"母亲正在品尝刚煮好的汤。"},{"t":"Boleh saya cicip kuah ini?","zh":"我可以尝一下这个汤汁吗？"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cicip","ipa":"/tʃitʃip/","zh":"品尝","phrase":{"t":"cicip rasa","zh":"品尝味道"},"example":{"t":"Dia cicip kopi itu.","zh":"他品尝了那杯咖啡。"}},{"w":"mencicip","ipa":"/mən.tʃitʃip/","zh":"正在品尝（主动词）","phrase":{"t":"mencicip hidangan","zh":"品尝佳肴"},"example":{"t":"Koki sedang mencicip saus buatannya.","zh":"厨师正在品尝他做的酱汁。"}},{"w":"mencicipi","ipa":"/mən.tʃitʃi.pi/","zh":"品尝（及物动词，强调对象）","phrase":{"t":"mencicipi kue","zh":"品尝糕点"},"example":{"t":"Saya ingin mencicipi kue buatanmu.","zh":"我想品尝你做的糕点。"}},{"w":"kecicipan","ipa":"/kə.tʃitʃi.pan/","zh":"被尝到（被动/意外尝到）","phrase":{"t":"tidak sengaja kecicipan","zh":"不小心尝到了"},"example":{"t":"Saya kecicipan sedikit saus pedas itu.","zh":"我不小心尝到了一点那个辣酱。"}}],"derSlugs":["cicip","mencicip","mencicipi","kecicipan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:33:08.138Z","src":"base"}